cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits (see "Citation metadata" in the contributing guide
  of elixir-cloud-aai).
title: NVFlare on WES and TES testbed
abstract: >-
  A sandbox for running federated learning jobs with NVIDIA FLARE through
  GA4GH Workflow Execution Service (WES) and Task Execution Service (TES),
  and an evaluation of the ways to do that: a thin WES with the FL server
  beside it, FL clients as TES tasks at each site, tests from a laptop to
  real ELIXIR Nodes, and a report of the results, gaps and proposals for
  TES. Not for production, and not for real data.
type: software
